  "description": "Our M12 Fuel™ HATCHET™ 6\" Pruning Saw offers unparalleled control and access, has the power to cut 3\" wood and delivers up to 120 cuts per load. This electric pruning saw is designed to meet the ergonomics, performance, and durability needs of landscape maintenance professionals. Weighing less than 2.3 kg and featuring a compact design, the cordless pruning saw provides better control and maneuverability in restricted areas. The POWERSTATE™ brushless motor provides the power to make cuts in demanding hardwood materials. Redlink Plus™ intelligence enables complete communication between tool and battery, delivering unparalleled levels of performance, protection and productivity. The advanced electronic box also offers instant throttle response and variable speed trigger for full control of the power range. The M12™ Redlithium™ XC 4.0Ah battery delivers the best in operation and performance. This pruning saw features a complete chain, easy access chain tensioner, automatic lubricator, metal tips and built-in scrench storage. The MILWAUKEE® M12 FUEL™ HATCHET™ 6\" Pruning Saw is part of the M12™ system that is fully compatible with over 100 solutions. In addition to the Pruning Saw (2527-20), this product includes (1) Oregon 6\" Bar and Chain, (1) Hem and (1) Scrench. Easy access chain tensioner, automatic lubricator, metal tips and built-in storage for scrench, charger and battery.",
